s.ny.gov/parks/135/"},{"name":"Watkins Glen State Park","blurb":"19 waterfalls in 2 miles of stone stairs and tunnels. The famous one.","town":"Watkins Glen","indoor":false,"drive":"45 min from Ithaca","url":"https://parks.ny.gov/parks/142/"},{"name":"Cascadilla Gorge Trail","blurb":"Six waterfalls climbing from downtown Ithaca up to Cornell. Short and steep.","town":"Ithaca","indoor":false,"drive":"in town","url":"https://cornellbotanicgardens.org/our-gardens/natural-areas/cascadilla-gorge/"},{"name":"Cornell Botanic Gardens","blurb":"Free. Herb garden, arboretum, and the Slim Jim Woods trails.","town":"Ithaca","indoor":false,"drive":"in town","url":"https://cornellbotanicgardens.org/"},{"name":"Stewart Park","blurb":"Cayuga Lake shoreline, carousel, big shade trees. Easy with no plan.","town":"Ithaca","indoor":false,"drive":"in town","url":"https://www.cityofithaca.org/234/Stewart-Park"},{"name":"Lime Hollow Nature Center","blurb":"Boardwalks, bog, treehouse. Closest real nature to the Airbnb.","town":"Cortland","indoor":false,"drive":"10 min from Cortland","url":"https://limehollow.org/"},{"name":"Greek Peak Mountain Coaster","blurb":"Alpine coaster you control. Also a zipline and adventure center.","town":"Cortland","indoor":false,"drive":"15 min from Cortland","url":"https://www.greekpeak.net/"},{"name":"Cayuga Lake Wine Trail","blurb":"Tasting rooms up both shores. Sheldrake Point and Six Mile Creek are the easy picks.","town":"Cayuga Lake","indoor":false,"drive":"20-50 min","url":"https://cayugawinetrail.com/"},{"name":"Museum of the Earth","blurb":"Full mastodon and a right whale skeleton. Good rain plan, about 2 hours.","town":"Ithaca","indoor":true,"drive":"30 min from Cortland","url":"https://www.museumoftheearth.org/"},{"name":"Herbert F. Johnson Museum of Art","blurb":"Free. I.M. Pei building, and the 5th floor has the best view of Cayuga Lake.","town":"Ithaca","indoor":true,"drive":"in Cornell campus","url":"https://museum.cornell.edu/"},{"name":"Sciencenter","blurb":"Hands-on science museum. Built for kids but the outdoor mini golf is fun regardless.","town":"Ithaca","indoor":true,"drive":"in town","url":"https://www.sciencenter.org/"},{"name":"Cortland Beer Company","blurb":"Small taproom downtown Cortland. Closest good beer to the Airbnb.","town":"Cortland","indoor":true,"drive":"5 min from Airbnb","url":"https://www.cortlandbeer.com/"},{"name":"1890 House Museum","blurb":"Chateau-style mansion with a tower you can climb. Right in Cortland.","town":"Cortland","indoor":true,"drive":"5 min from Airbnb","url":"https://www.the1890house.org/"},{"name":"Cortland Repertory Theatre","blurb":"Summer stock at the Pavilion in Little York Lake. Check what is running.","town":"Cortland","indoor":true,"drive":"15 min from Airbnb","url":"https://www.cortlandrep.org/"}],"links":[{"label":"Waterfalls","url":"https://www.reddit.com/r/ithaca/comments/nq3a5m/waterfalls_outside_ithaca_that_dont_require_much/"},{"label":"Food","url":"https://www.reddit.com/r/ithaca/comments/1k683oo/best_food_for_out_of_towners_ex_locals/"}],"photos":["photo-20260812-021602-mmvj0t.jpg","photo-20260812-015849-6d0tv0.jpg","photo-20250816-181708-gpirdb.jpg","photo-20250816-145335-i6i8tj.jpg","photo-20220805-194748-llg4sv.jpg","photo-20220805-191207-l5o81a.jpg","photo-20220805-134813-z06hak.jpg"],"stay":[{"label":"Address","value":"2016 Alpha Circle\nCortland, NY 13045","url":"","long":false},{"label":"Listing","value":"https://www.airbnb.com/rooms/1181330297215578370","url":"https://www.airbnb.com/rooms/1181330297215578370","long":false},{"label":"Host Contact","value":"Lyza Feint\n607-220-9044\nlyza.nicole@live.com","url":"","long":false},{"label":"Check In","value":"Thu, 8/13 @ 3pm","url":"","long":false},{"label":"Check Out","value":"Sun, 8/16 @ 11am","url":"","long":false},{"label":"Check In Instructions","value":"Key located inside lockbox, on front door. Code: 0150","url":"","long":false},{"label":"Check Out Instructions","value":"- Check out 11 